- Caveat: there are different counter sizes depending on an algorithm.
- salsa & chacha also differ in structures of key & sigma:
  salsa20:      s[0] | k(4) | s[1] | nonce(2) | cnt(2) | s[2] | k(4) | s[3]
  chacha:       s(4) | k(8) | cnt(1) | nonce(3)
